<title>BAHRAIN: Al-Ahli Commercial Bank nine-month net up.</title>
<headline>Al-Ahli Commercial Bank nine-month net up.</headline>
<dateline>MANAMA 1996-10-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p>			    (million Bahraini dinars) </p>
<p>Net profit		   4.33     vs    4.16</p>
<p>Operating income	   8.71     vs    7.48</p>
<p>Operating expenses	 3.32     vs    3.00</p>
<p> Shareholders' equity    40.84    vs   37.46</p>
<p>Assets			233.14    vs  215.33</p>
<p>Customer deposits	163.32     vs 146.23</p>
<p>Full Name: Al-Ahli Commercial Bank B.S.C.</p>
<p>Note - The bank is the third largest commercial bank in Bahrain.</p>
</text>
